{"id":"n55830-1-9","stage":5,"title":"모호하다 · 模糊","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55830-1-9-1","ko":"저 친구의 대답이 참 모호하네.","zh":"那个朋友的回答真是模棱两可啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71215","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"친구의","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구의","audio":"/audio/89d1c15c6226a38d288d.mp3"}},{"text":"대답이","meaning":"回答，解答","explanation":"대답：回答，解答；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"대답","audio":"/audio/bd8a8d233373a1c01779.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64540","senseId":"2","lemma":"대답","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대답이","audio":"/audio/fbe1bfe89211576ec856.mp3"}},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确。","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}},{"text":"모호하네.","meaning":"模糊","explanation":"모호하다：模糊；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"모호하다","audio":"/audio/e471cb0c6c957943ed11.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55830","senseId":"1","lemma":"모호하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모호하네","audio":"/audio/9ff5804415bbec3f6509.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71215","definition":"用于指示与话者、听者离得很远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"bd8a8d233373a1c0","term":"대답","zh":"回答，解答","audio":"/audio/bd8a8d233373a1c01779.mp3","entryId":"64540","definition":"对问或要求的事情做出相应的答复；或指那样的话。","pronunciation":["대ː답"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"e471cb0c6c957943","term":"모호하다","zh":"模糊","audio":"/audio/e471cb0c6c957943ed11.mp3","entryId":"55830","definition":"指言中之意或摆出的态度不明确。","pronunciation":["모호하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e95a6e5cd095428d088c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n55830-1-9-2","ko":"그러게. 일을 하겠다는 건지 안 하겠다는 건지 모르겠어.","zh":"是啊，根本不知道他是打算做这份工作还是不想做。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러게.","meaning":"就是嘛，可不嘛","explanation":"그러게：就是嘛，可不嘛。","readings":[{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36269","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}},{"text":"일을","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일을","audio":"/audio/9a5fd6c2b18669a93295.mp3"}},{"text":"하겠다는","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；다는：引用陈述内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하겠다는","audio":"/audio/69ab173b9212db69549a.mp3"}},{"text":"건지","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건지","audio":"/audio/907ab40269ad34a8bdf1.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"하겠다는","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；다는：引用陈述内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하겠다는","audio":"/audio/69ab173b9212db69549a.mp3"}},{"text":"건지","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건지","audio":"/audio/907ab40269ad34a8bdf1.mp3"}},{"text":"모르겠어.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르겠어","audio":"/audio/b0a5887fc79197b11412.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"87d7b69edce28452","term":"그러게","zh":"就是嘛，可不嘛","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3","entryId":"36269","definition":"用于赞成或同意对方所说的话。","pronunciation":["그러게"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronu